# Random Number Service
# This file defines the structure of a ROS service request and response.
#
# Each line in the request section describes an input value sent by the client.
# Each line in the response section describes the value returned by the server.
#
# Example:
#   Request: minimum and maximum bounds for the random value
#   Response: generated random integer within that range

int64 min_value
int64 max_value
---
int64 random_number
